title: mog - deterministic L3 limit-order-book backtesting engine
message: >-
  If you use mog in research, please cite it using this metadata.
authors:
  - family-names: Barfa
    given-names: Kanak
    email: kanakbarfa@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KanakBarfa/mog"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic nanosecond-scale limit-order-book backtesting engine.
  ITCH 5.0 ingestion, an L3 matching core with contract-checked bounds,
  an execution simulator with latency and NASDAQ-native order types, and
  byte-exact cross-language reproducibility pinned by golden digests.
keywords:
  - market-data
  - order-book
  - backtesting
  - itch
  - determinism
